{"unit_id":"yangshen830-eng__dsh-editor#card-zh","repo":"yangshen830-eng/dsh-editor","commit":"dafd1d6a91366e37a53844e3d3ef35e34dd30dd9","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-editor（DSH 网页插件）：在会话主区加入文件工作区，让用户直接浏览和编辑项目文件。它通过 Host 与浏览器客户端之间的 RPC 连接提供文件树、Monaco 多文件编辑、跨文件搜索与替换、Git 状态和差异查看，以及 Markdown 预览。文件树以用户 home 目录为起点，搜索可使用 ripgrep，界面还支持快速打开、编辑器快捷键和明暗主题同步。适合希望在 DSH 对话旁查看代码、修改文件并检查版本差异的开发者。使用时浏览器端需从 jsDelivr 加载编辑器和预览所需资源。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:1803-1815","lib/index.js:494-522","lib/client.js:12","lib/client.js:102-109"]}
{"unit_id":"yangshen830-eng__dsh-editor#card-en","repo":"yangshen830-eng/dsh-editor","commit":"dafd1d6a91366e37a53844e3d3ef35e34dd30dd9","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-editor (DSH web plugin) adds a file workspace beside conversations. Host and browser halves use RPC for a file tree, Monaco editing, search and replacement, Git diffs, and Markdown preview. Developers can edit files in DSH, use quick open, and sync themes. Browser resources load from jsDelivr.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:1803-1815","lib/index.js:494-522","lib/client.js:12","lib/client.js:102-109"]}
